# Product Requirement Document (PRD): KeeTech Agency Platform
**Document Version:** 2.2  
**Target Domain:** keetech.my.id  
**Brand Positioning:** Modern Enterprise IT & AI Solutions Agency  
**Target Tech Stack:** Next.js 14+ (App Router), React.js, Tailwind CSS, Shadcn UI, Framer Motion, Lucide Icons, Laravel (Backend/API)

---

## 1. Executive Summary & Objectives
KeeTech bertransformasi dari penyedia layanan IT umum menjadi **Modern IT & AI Solutions Agency**. Platform web ini berfungsi sebagai *company profile*, *brand authority*, dan *interactive showcase* untuk menarik kepercayaan klien korporat, instansi pemerintah, serta pebisnis modern.

### Core Value Propositions:
- **Dual Specialty Division:** Memisahkan operasional menjadi 2 divisi utama yaitu **Software & AI Innovation** (Developer Team) dan **Support & Infrastructure** (On-Site Team).
- **AI-Powered Solutions:** Menunjukkan kapabilitas modern dalam integrasi AI, otomatisasi workflow, dan pembuatan perangkat lunak skala enterprise.
- **Outcome-Based Showcase:** Menampilkan portofolio bukan sekadar galeri gambar, melainkan narasi berbasis dampak bisnis (*business impact*).

---

## 2. Information Architecture & Page Map
keetech.my.id/
├── / (Home / Landing Page)
│   ├── Hero Section (Enterprise Tagline + Dual CTA)
│   ├── Division Showcase (Software & AI vs Support & Infra)
│   ├── Interactive Service Estimator / Inquiry Form
│   ├── Featured Case Studies Preview
│   └── Trust & Legitimations (SLA, Team Structure, Warranty)
├── /services (Detailed Division Breakdown)
├── /portfolio (Directory Case Studies & Interactive Filter)
├── /portfolio/[slug] (Single Case Study Detail Page)
└── /contact (Official Contact & Meeting Scheduling)